      "content": "The `blogkategorie` taxonomy that groups blog entries. 12 terms were readable anonymously at probe time.\n\nDerived by API Evangelist from the live WordPress REST API discovery document at https://www.exentis-group.com/wp-json/ and anonymous sample responses. Exentis Group publishes no developer portal; this documents the machine-readable surface its own public host serves. Read-only without credentials; writes require a WordPress application password.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Exentis Group AG\n Email: info@exentis-group.com",
